-R IR" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1282" y="395" width="150" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c24"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="Ext Tanks Off: the long (Ext) tanks are out of circuit entirely, and the&#10;Short/Long Reverb mix knob does nothing in this mode.&#10;&#10;Predelay windows are one per lane, implemented 2026-09-30 in PluginProcessor.cpp (predelayLaneMinMs / predelayLaneMaxMs).&#10;Before that, L and R shared one window per pair (both short lanes 20 to 30, both long lanes 30 to 42). Each lane still wanders&#10;independently inside its own window, so L and R are now decorrelated from each other as well as from the long tanks." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="680" width="1100" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="HPF&#10;Sallen-Key&#10;Q 0.71" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1476" y="200" width="100" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.0938;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c22" target="c27"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.6875;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c24" target="c27"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="Gain&#10;-18 to +18 dB" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1620" y="200" width="120" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="Dirt (Gain pull)&#10;TS808, TL072H&#10;1N4148W pair&#10;&#10;+9VC&#10;clips at +/-4.5 V" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffcccc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1784" y="200" width="150" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="Comp / Off / Limit&#10;&#10;Comp: MMBF5457 FET&#10;(1176 territory)&#10;Limit: V2181 VCA&#10;10:1&#10;&#10;+/-15 V" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1978" y="200" width="170" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="LPF&#10;Sallen-Key&#10;Q 0.74" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2192" y="200" width="100" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="rail 14 V&#10;(+/-15 V)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2336" y="200" width="80" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c27" target="c30"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c30" target="c31"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent=