ml=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.7917;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c39" target="c45"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c48" value="Parallel, as built. The two tanks run side by side and are summed.&#10;Hard left = short only, noon = both at full, hard right = long only.&#10;No +6 dB makeup here, unlike Series.&#10;NOTE: the long branch taps the wet input BEFORE the short lane&#x27;s predelay and uses&#10;only its own window, so the two tanks are not fed the same timing.&#10;&#10;Predelay windows are one per lane, implemented 2026-09-30 in PluginProcessor.cpp (predelayLaneMinMs / predelayLaneMaxMs).&#10;Before that, L and R shared one window per pair (both short lanes 20 to 30, both long lanes 30 to 42). Each lane still wanders&#10;independently inside its own window, so L and R are now decorrelated from each other as well as from the long tanks." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="680" width="1200" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c49" value="HPF&#10;Sallen-Key&#10;Q 0.71" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1804" y="200" width="100" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c50" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.2031;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c42" target="c49"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c51" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.7969;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c45" target="c49"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c52" value="Gain&#10;-18 to +18 dB" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;ht